### 🗂️ **Grouped Use Cases**

#### ✅ Formal Situations (जैसे Office, Interview, Meeting)

* Good morning, sir.
* How do you do?
* Nice to meet you.
* Have a pleasant day.

#### ✅ Informal Situations (जैसे दोस्त, परिवार)

* Hey! What’s up?
* Hi, buddy!
* Long time no see!
* See ya!

